            "type": "notes",
            "label": "Notes",
            "title": "Ripple bed",
            "style": "notes",
            "note": "A dim bed follows led-color on every cue-called keepalive; when the StageKit is dark led-color is 'transparent' so the bed passes through to the black floor."
          },
          {
            "id": "rb3-ripple-note-2",
            "type": "notes",
            "label": "Notes",
            "title": "Edges as travelling energy",
            "style": "notes",
            "note": "Each LED on-edge launches a one-shot colour sweep on layer 50: LEDs 1-4 cross the front row left-to-right, LEDs 5-8 the back row right-to-left (the back array reversed). fog-on adds a white mist swell. Strobes are the classic full-rig white."
          }
